From 6c9de6d0e76b8051f90cc55f9233d8b1a3b536cf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 17:00:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] v117.1: fixes from the v117 validation run

- git retry rule and failure family match git's multi-line error; certificate/not-found seed repos are skipped
- directory copies no longer chmod setgid (RestrictSUIDSGID): skin installer, proxy launcher, app runner;
  an installed package with the old installer is refreshed from the shipped one
- pipeline start resumes heals left mid-round and stops orphaned app containers
- install_browser: pinned Playwright, installs OS libraries as root, launch-checks; rule for BROWSER_EXCEPTION
- bundle tests build a matching manifest, so ADM accepts real release zips
- an owner's re-upload updates the app (rebuilt from source); another account's same-name upload is refused
- bash run local as root stays a laptop instance; the seed list is installed once

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AQwycJi8eqTo6GVPCjUZqa
